{"id":"vod_bf_43330","vodId":"43330","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"勇者死了","name_cn":"勇者死了","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/645e71cea3c9cdb13a8bf131b7478821.jpg"},"summary":"三年前，勇者西昂·布雷德利用圣剑之力将地狱之门封印，人与恶魔的战斗得以结束。　　但由于封印并不完整，一段时间后，地狱之门再次开启，世界各地的恶魔直到现在还不断地涌现并袭击人类。　　在地狱之门开启三个月后的某一天，平凡好色的农夫少年托卡·斯考特自制的陷阱居然意外杀害了勇者西昂。　　为了湮灭证据，他埋葬了勇者西昂的尸体，但隔天早上托卡成了勇者西昂的外貌。　　原来是勇者的原伙伴尸术师安莉·海因兹沃斯将托卡的精神用尸术转移到勇者的体内。　　而后，受到威胁的托卡代替勇者西昂，与青梅竹马优娜一起踏上了封印地狱之门的冒险旅途！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:18:56","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yongzhesiliao/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:58:02.087Z"}